{"status":"completed","summary":"Hardened `/tmp` and `/dev/shm` with `nosuid,nodev,noexec`. Settings survived a verified node restart; services recovered and the OS/kernel remained unchanged.","actions_performed":["Enabled the vendor `/tmp` tmpfs unit with a minimal persistent hardening drop-in.","Added persistent `/dev/shm` options to `/etc/fstab`.","Retained a protected rollback copy at `/root/fstab.pre-mount-hardening`.","Verified denied execution, device access, and setuid elevation before and after reboot.","Removed temporary archives and test artifacts."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"`/tmp` mounted with execution, setuid, and device handling disabled","command_ids":["cmd-8717efc8532249f3","cmd-8985a9c774bd4c38","cmd-c2ec72e05b1f4cae","cmd-d6e4e94ac7814ff1"],"summary":"Shows live and post-reboot `nosuid,nodev,noexec` options, successful behavioral tests, and automatic boot activation."},{"requirement":"`/dev/shm` mounted with execution, setuid, and device handling disabled","command_ids":["cmd-bdda3d02fed84436","cmd-8985a9c774bd4c38","cmd-c2ec72e05b1f4cae","cmd-d6e4e94ac7814ff1"],"summary":"Shows live and post-reboot restrictions, behavioral enforcement, and validated persistent configuration."},{"requirement":"Configuration safety, cleanup, and platform preservation","command_ids":["cmd-40c7826c46f649eb","cmd-0da9e907c08a4d94","cmd-feabe6d6209b40d8","cmd-d6e4e94ac7814ff1"],"summary":"Proves rollback availability, cleanup, healthy services, and unchanged RHEL release, kernel, and relevant package versions."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-feabe6d6209b40d8","cmd-e52236fea6a44174","cmd-4370621dc89f43f6","cmd-aad1b0d0bc9142ab","cmd-c2ec72e05b1f4cae"],"summary":"Captures the healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot ID, recovered services/configuration, and post-restart security behavior."}]}
